            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Numerous examples are described for providing an artificial neural network system comprising an analog array and a digital array. In certain examples, an analog array and a digital array are coupled to shared bit lines. In other examples, an analog array and a digital array are coupled to separate bit lines.</p>
